"privacy.data_use.content" = "We use your data to:\n• Prepare your tax return\n• Communicate with you\n• Improve our services\n• Comply with legal obligations\n\nWe never sell your data to third parties.";
"privacy.data_protection.title" = "4. Data Protection";
"privacy.data_protection.content" = "We use industry-standard security measures:\n• End-to-end encryption\n• Secure cloud storage\n• Regular security audits\n• Access control and authentication\n\nYour data is protected under Swiss data protection law.";
